# Tags and properties
Output docs/media/tags.gif
Source docs/media/tapes/common.tape

Hide
Type "export ORG_DEMO_DIR=/tmp/org-demo-tags; clear; nvim -u docs/media/demo/init.lua $ORG_DEMO_DIR/projects.org" Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Show
Sleep 1s
Shift+Tab
Sleep 300ms
Shift+Tab
Sleep 800ms
Type "/Fix the"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Hide
Ctrl+G
Type@5ms `Cap <leader>ot set tags with fast keys` Enter
Show
Type " ot"
Sleep 1.5s
Type "w"
Sleep 600ms
Type "u"
Sleep 600ms
Type "r"
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 1.2s
Hide
Ctrl+G
Type@5ms `Cap <leader>oxe set the effort` Enter
Show
Type " oxe"
Sleep 1.2s
Type "2"
Enter
Sleep 1.2s
Hide
Ctrl+G
Type@5ms `Cap <leader>op set any property` Enter
Show
Type " op"
Sleep 1.2s
Type "OWNER"
Enter
Sleep 800ms
Type "Ana"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Sleep 1.5s
